OL,3,GNEWSAQuadruplets among students in
OL,4,ASouth celebrating GCSE success
OL,5,
OL,6,FSchools across the region reported
OL,7,Fparticularly strong results in English
OL,8,Fand maths, with head teachers praising
OL,9,Fpupils for their hard work,
OL,10,Fdetermination and resilience throughout
OL,11,Ftwo demanding years of study.
OL,13,FBBC South spoke to some of those
OL,14,Fpicking up their results in
OL,15,FOxfordshire, Berkshire, Hampshire and
OL,16,FDorset.
